{"severity":"error","file":"errors/role_grant_exceeded_1.march","start_line":26,"start_col":12,"end_line":26,"end_col":22,"message":"The body of role `Cons` writes a file, but the role is granted only `Cap(IO.Console)` (`role Cons needs IO.Console`). A role's grant bounds everything its code reaches, as `main`'s grant bounds the program.\nhelp: add `IO.FileWrite` to `role Cons needs ...` in protocol `Stream`, or remove the use.","code":"role_grant_exceeded","fix":null,"labels":[{"file":"errors/role_grant_exceeded_1.march","start_line":38,"start_col":25,"end_line":38,"end_col":29,"message":"the body calls `cons` here"},{"file":"errors/role_grant_exceeded_1.march","start_line":32,"start_col":6,"end_line":32,"end_col":10,"message":"`cons` calls `save` here"},{"file":"errors/role_grant_exceeded_1.march","start_line":38,"start_col":6,"end_line":38,"end_col":41,"message":"the body of role `Cons`, passed to `Stream_Run.run_Cons`"},{"file":"errors/role_grant_exceeded_1.march","start_line":14,"start_col":4,"end_line":14,"end_col":30,"message":"role `Cons` is granted only `Cap(IO.Console)` here"}],"notes":[],"category":"CAPABILITY"}
